pps/3400110/extras/b30b9e49c4ddc9d0273f2ff9be608877.mp4?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your robot is yours to engineer. Three systems define your build: Frame, Parts, and Moves. Every choice changes how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>20+ moves at once from combos, directionals, specials and utilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want air combos? Build for launches. Want to absorb hits and counter? Build for armor. Rapid strikes, crushing blows, and defensive utilities are all yours to mix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Name them. Paint them. Make them yours before you make them dangerous.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat Goes Louder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/17642b1e92c0bc59b39775ea56c9443d.poster.avif?t=1772892695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/17642b1e92c0bc59b39775ea56c9443d.webm?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/17642b1e92c0bc59b39775ea56c9443d.mp4?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your power meter fills, combat doesn't just scale in numbers. It shifts physically. Every consecutive hit amplifies the sound, multiplies the visual effects, and pushes the fight from precise and controlled into screen-shaking, explosive chaos</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt or Get Scrapped</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b28e27ee7f56d802f5d3e2dd2e5d389a.poster.avif?t=1772892695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b28e27ee7f56d802f5d3e2dd2e5d389a.webm?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b28e27ee7f56d802f5d3e2dd2e5d389a.mp4?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the wastes with a <strong>squad of three robots</strong>. Your goal is to gather iron to repair a broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every step forward forces a brutal choice:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you retreat and <strong>repair</strong> your damaged squad?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you <strong>upgrade </strong>them?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do you risk it and <strong>push forward</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/c0d3d86bdae7033a2cf567f5cdabd54e.poster.avif?t=1772892695\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/c0d3d86bdae7033a2cf567f5cdabd54e.webm?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/c0d3d86bdae7033a2cf567f5cdabd54e.mp4?t=1772892695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["2071 Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/e0351278005dd7d512f6cbc8357e994cf7c524de/header.jpg?t=1772892695","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/